# Google Maps Platform API Key (Required)
# Never commit real API keys to source control. Copy this file to .env and paste your key.
#
# Quickstart — Free Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key (for prototyping only):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with a Google account (no billing card or Cloud project required).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Click to generate/reveal your Demo Key and copy it below.
#
# Production Setup:
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, and Roads API in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
